Journey: Automation Exercise search, product, cart and contact form
Tags: @automationexercise
Base URL: https://automationexercise.com

Open /
  Expect the page contains "Full-Fledged practice website for Automation Engineers"
Click the "Products" link
  Expect the URL contains "/products"
  Expect the page contains "All Products"
Type "jeans" into the Search Product field
Click #submit_search
  Expect the page contains "Searched Products"
Click the "View Product" link in the row containing "Soft Stretch Jeans"
  Expect the URL contains "/product_details/"
  Expect the page contains "Availability: In Stock"
Clear #quantity
Type "3" into #quantity
Click the "Add to cart" button
  Expect the page contains "Your product has been added to cart."
Click the "View Cart" link
  Expect the URL contains "/view_cart"
  Expect the page contains "Soft Stretch Jeans"
  Expect the "3" button is visible
Click the "Contact us" link
  Expect the page contains "Get In Touch"
Type "Ada" into the Name field
Type "ada@example.com" into the Email field
Type "Order question" into the Subject field
Type "Where is my order?" into the Your Message Here field
Accept the next confirm dialog
Click the "Submit" button
  Expect the page contains "Success! Your details have been submitted successfully."
